<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17534" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">factūra</span></b> , ae, f.
		facio, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a making</i>, <i>manufacture</i>, <i>formation</i>, = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποίησις</span> (post-Aug. and very rare). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in nostro orbe aliubi vena bonitatem hanc
					praestat, aliubi factura,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					34, 14, 41, § 145</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corporis totius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 13, 29, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Num. 8,
			4</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>pass.</i>, <i>a thing produced</i> or <i>created</i>, <i>a creature</i>, <i>work</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">anima factura dei est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prud. Apoth. 792</span></i>
			; so <i><span class="en">id. 856</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Eph. 2,
				10</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
